why it didn't look great otherwise the footage is bright and clear. While it doesn't support external mics it has a good battery life and charges fast. If you wish to buy the camera please click the link below","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCAr8bsrV9GuS-2YMqMU4c8A\">CLOSE ABOUT</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY 3.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}}}]},"122485400":{"pageid":122485400,"ns":6,"title":"File:Siena Agudong on Sienna & Marlana.jpg","index":9,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":115820,"width":1326,"height":1165,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a2/Siena_Agudong_on_Sienna_%26_Marlana.jpg/960px-Siena_Agudong_on_Sienna_%26_Marlana.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":640,"thumbheight":562,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a2/Siena_Agudong_on_Sienna_%26_Marlana.jpg/1280px-Siena_Agudong_on_Sienna_%26_Marlana.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail"},"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a2/Siena_Agudong_on_Sienna_%26_Marlana.jpg/960px-Siena_Agudong_on_Sienna_%26_Marlana.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":640,"height":562,"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a2/Siena_Agudong_on_Sienna_%26_Marlana.jpg/1280px-Siena_Agudong_on_Sienna_%26_Marlana.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail 2x"},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a2/Siena_Agudong_on_Sienna_%26_Marlana.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Siena_Agudong_on_Sienna_%26_Marlana.jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=122485400","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"Thank You Siena Agudong\n<p>Thanks from New Zealand to #SienaAgudong see her on #NoGoodNick #Nickelodeon\n</p><p>About Sienna and Marlana\nPosting just about every week, you'll see us travel on holidays, and share things with you about New Zealand where we live, and England, France, Australia, and America where we have travelled. Join us in some fun! Take a look as we vlog teen life, our favourite moments, challenge ourselves with things we have never done before, and enjoy life. When we go on a trip, spend time with our family or try to make school projects fun, our vlogging camera is never too far away and always ready to catch our fun moments. Find out our favourite apps, games, foods, clothes, books, and movies. Want to see us take on a challenge? Well, make sure to subscribe and comment today about what you\u2019d like to see!\n</p>\n<ol><li>teens, #twins #siennaandmarlana #twingirls</li></ol>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/SiennaAndMarlana\">Sienna &amp; Marlana</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY 3.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}}}]},"133483727":{"pageid":133483727,"ns":6,"title":"File:Sony ZV-E1 with Sony FE 28-60mm F4-5.6 - by Henry S\u00f6derlund (52854053098).jpg","index":4,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":8361307,"width":6999,"height":4666,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/60/Sony_ZV-E1_with_Sony_FE_28-60mm_F4-5.6_-_by_Henry_S%C3%B6derlund_%2852854053098%29.jpg/960px-Sony_ZV-E1_with_Sony_FE_28-60mm_F4-5.6_-_by_Henry_S%C3%B6derlund_%2852854053098%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":640,"thumbheight":427,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/