nd (42409532595).jpg","index":6,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":933494,"width":1920,"height":1280,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bb/Sony_a5000_Isolated_on_White_Background_%2842409532595%29.jpg/960px-Sony_a5000_Isolated_on_White_Background_%2842409532595%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":640,"thumbheight":427,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bb/Sony_a5000_Isolated_on_White_Background_%2842409532595%29.jpg/1280px-Sony_a5000_Isolated_on_White_Background_%2842409532595%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail"},"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bb/Sony_a5000_Isolated_on_White_Background_%2842409532595%29.jpg/960px-Sony_a5000_Isolated_on_White_Background_%2842409532595%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":640,"height":427,"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bb/Sony_a5000_Isolated_on_White_Background_%2842409532595%29.jpg/1280px-Sony_a5000_Isolated_on_White_Background_%2842409532595%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail 2x"},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bb/Sony_a5000_Isolated_on_White_Background_%2842409532595%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sony_a5000_Isolated_on_White_Background_(42409532595).jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=124349048","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"<p>I decided I wanted a \"better\" camera for vlogging than my a7. Well, better is a relative term. My a7 is superior to the a5000 in virtually every way... except the a5000 has a flip screen. So it's easier to see myself with.\n</p>\nI also wanted another camera to play around with and shoot B-roll.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/people/94359914@N06\">John Brighenti</a> from Rockville, MD, United States","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY 2.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}}}]},"62387725":{"pageid":62387725,"ns":6,"title":"File:Steve Lyons.jpg","index":5,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":45691,"width":900,"height":600,"thumburl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/04/Steve_Lyons.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","thumbwidth":640,"thumbheight":427,"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/04/Steve_Lyons.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":640,"height":427},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/04/Steve_Lyons.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Steve_Lyons.jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=62387725","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"Steve Lyons vlogging on his camera.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=User:Losangelesnews&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"User:Losangelesnews (page does not exist)\">Losangelesnews</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 4.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}}}]},"151710524":{"pageid":151710524,"ns":6,"title":"File:The Ride of Perseid - 2016. (28942686275).jpg","index":7,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":2183006,"width":5152,"height":3864,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/23/The_Ride_of_Perseid_-_2016._%2828942686275%29.jpg/960px-The_Ride_of_Perseid_-_2016._%2828942686275%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":640,"thumbheight":480,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/23/The_Ride_of_Perseid_-_2016._%2828942686275%29.jpg/1280px-The_Ride_of_Perseid_-_2016._%2828942686275%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail"},"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/23/The_Ride_of_Perseid_-_2016._%2828942686275%29.jpg/960px-The_Ride_of_Perseid_-_2016._%2828942686275%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":640,"height":480,"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/23/The_Ride_of_Perseid_-_2016._%2828942686275%29.jpg/1280px-The_Ride_of_Perseid_-_2016._%2828942686275%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail 2x"},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/23/The_Ride_of_Perseid_-_2016._%2828942686275%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_Ride_of_Perseid_-_2016._(28942686275).jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=151710524","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"<p>I haven't had a proper camera (other than my point and shoot Canon SX610 that I use for vlogging), over the past few months. I used a Sony DSC H300, not meant for this kind of stuff at all. \n</p><p>Still, not so bad in terms of a result.\n</p><p>The Perseids weren't flying that much past 2 am where I was, clouds slowly moved in and humidity levels shot way up. The sky was nothing but texture. It's been a hot and humid summer in Buffalo, heat indexes at 100 degrees, drought for the past 3 months, more brutal than usual.\n</p>\nIt was fun to hang out and relax again at the Observatory. I haven't been in a while, so it was something I missed dearly.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/people/72791630@N00\">Ryan  Hallock</a> from Topanga, California, USA","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY 2.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}}}]},"62191305":{"pageid":62191305,"ns":6,"title":"File:Trump supporter live vlogging from MLK park. (36887397875).jpg","index":1,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":2157233,"width":3000,"height":1688,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/Trump_supporter_live_vlogging_from_MLK_park._%2836887397875%29.jpg/960px-Trump_supporter_live_vlogging_from_MLK_park._%2836887397875%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":640,"thumbheight":360,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/Trump_supporter_live_vlogging_from_MLK_park._%2836887397875%29.jpg/1280px-Trump_supporter_live_vlogging_from_MLK_park._%2836887397875%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail"},"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/Trump_supporter_live_vlogging_from_MLK_park._%2836887397875%29.jpg/960px-Trump_supporter_live_vlogging_from_MLK_park._%2836887397875%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":640,"height":360,"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/Trump_supporter_live_vlogging_from_MLK_park._%2836887397875%29.jpg/1280px-Trump_supporter_live_vlogging_from_MLK_park._%2836887397875%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail 2x"},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikiped